I tried it out in wizard mode; if you wish for the Tsurugi, then you can't
go on the quest, and therefore can't get the Bell of Opening (which, however,
then, I believe, you can wish for).  But there is a way to get by that...

Before you go in to talk to Lord Sato, drop the Tsurugi (don't have it on
your body), and Lord Sato will think that you don't have the Tsurugi, and send
you on the quest.  Incidentally, when you kill Ashikaga Takauji, you'll find
an ordinary tsurugi (not another Tsurugi of Muramasa) with him.

